# ------------------------------------------------- metrics (clerk token)

### default window 15m - cards + chart series
GET {{base}}/agents/{{agentId}}/metrics
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1 hour window
GET {{base}}/agents/{{agentId}}/metrics?window=1h
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6 hour window - points get averaged into buckets
GET {{base}}/agents/{{agentId}}/metrics?window=6h
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### poll shape - only points newer than the last one you drew
GET {{base}}/agents/{{agentId}}/metrics?window=15m&since=2026-10-15T09:40:12Z
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 400 - bad window
GET {{base}}/agents/{{agentId}}/metrics?window=abc
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 404 - agent that is not yours
GET {{base}}/agents/agent_doesnotexist0000000000000000/metrics
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

